{"id":1792255,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-09T17:45:28.224Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1792255,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Saints paradice","overview":"Ben Kinmont’s film Saints paradice (2024-25) draws on the 8mm film archive of artist Jilala Jet von Jalopy, among others, to portray the Angels of Light Free Theater and the new worlds they made possible by sharing a communal life together. The Angels of Light were founded by Hibiscus in 1970 and emerged out of the Sutter Street Commune. Footage covers the years of 1970 to 1978 and shows the Angels on-stage and outdoors, performing in various parks around San Francisco. The film's soundtrack is performed by Scrumbly who was a member of both the Angels of Light and the Cockettes. This film can be shown at anytime and by anyone so long as it is shown for free.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/sdQSWYUAApqAGshREWH2UD4SjkJ.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":313675,"logo_path":null,"name":"The Antinomian Press","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2025-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":29,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"A film made free","title":"Saints paradice","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6536518,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Ben Kinmont","original_name":"Ben Kinmont","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6ac86519f1da9a8891ab421f","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6536529,"known_for_department":"Camera","name":"Jilala Jet von Jalopy","original_name":"Jilala Jet von Jalopy","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6ac8665de0186d3341ab41f5","department":"Camera","job":"Director of Photography"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6536534,"known_for_depa